          "Engage the 63% demographic gap with specificity and without tokenization—Hispanic voters, American Indian constituents, and other communities in this district have distinct governance concerns (immigration enforcement, tribal sovereignty, healthcare access) that require real legislative attention, not acknowledgment language.",
