          "Lead with renter-specific economic messaging: at 47.3% renter occupancy, housing cost, eviction protection, and rental market regulation are not secondary issues — they are primary constituent concerns for nearly half the district; a candidate who cannot speak credibly about keeping renters in their homes and controlling housing costs will not persuade this constituency.",
