          "Lead with college-educated suburban economic concerns: the 28.2% college attainment and $81,593 income profile this district as affluent homeowners evaluating on property taxes, education funding, and whether government delivers for their economic interests—not as a reliably conservative voting bloc. This is the swing constituency that determines whether 69% holds or contracts.",
